A sign-in endpoint applies the following limit, written for this course.

```
const attempts = new Map();          // source address -> count

function allow(source) {
  const n = (attempts.get(source) ?? 0) + 1;
  attempts.set(source, n);
  return n <= 10;                     // ten attempts per address
}
```

